WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.963
Tumhe laga hoga... Ganpati

2
00:00:01.983 --> 00:00:03.780
ka itna bada julus...

3
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.535
पंडाल.... Ye hazaron saal

4
00:00:05.555 --> 00:00:06.710
se chal raha hai?

5
00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:08.166
Sach ye hai... Atharah

6
00:00:08.186 --> 00:00:09.660
sau tiryaanve se pehle...

7
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.414
Ganesh Chaturthi zyada tar

8
00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:12.405
ek ghar ke andar

9
00:00:12.425 --> 00:00:13.581
ka tyohar tha. वो

10
00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:15.886
बड़ा स्ट्रीट पंडाल... वो

11
00:00:15.906 --> 00:00:18.508
जुलूस... Hazaron logo ka

12
00:00:18.528 --> 00:00:20.451
ikattha hona... Ye tha

13
00:00:20.471 --> 00:00:21.934
hi nahi. Phir ek

14
00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:23.600
aadmi ne isse badal

15
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.230
diya. बाल गंगाधर तिलक।

16
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.693
British ne public sabha

17
00:00:27.713 --> 00:00:28.717
pe ban laga rakha

18
00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:29.778
tha. Toh Tilak ne

19
00:00:29.798 --> 00:00:31.123
Ganpati puja ko bahana

20
00:00:31.143 --> 00:00:32.664
banaya... Logo ko sadkon

21
00:00:32.684 --> 00:00:34.355
pe ikattha kiya... Castes

22
00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:35.977
ko jodkar... Azadi ki

23
00:00:35.997 --> 00:00:37.525
ladai ke liye taiyar

24
00:00:37.545 --> 00:00:38.677
kiya. Toh is baar

25
00:00:38.697 --> 00:00:40.023
apne mohalle ka pandal

26
00:00:40.043 --> 00:00:41.736
dekho... Ye sirf tyohar

27
00:00:41.756 --> 00:00:43.213
nahi hai. Ye azadi

28
00:00:43.233 --> 00:00:44.896
ki ladai ka hathiyar

29
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.378
tha... Jo aaj tak

30
00:00:46.398 --> 00:00:48.016
zinda hai. Aisi chhupi

31
00:00:48.036 --> 00:00:49.486
history ke liye... Channel

32
00:00:49.506 --> 00:00:50.134
follow kar lo.

